      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The ghost sees the dust motes dancing in the sunlight, a stark reminder of how quickly the house settles into a new, quiet normality. The laughter from the sister sounds like a distant, unbroken melody, and the scent of cooking food fills the air with a warmth that feels entirely real and unearned. You are not a part of this rhythm, and the silence you bring to the room is the only thing that truly disrupts their peace.\n\nYes, you made their lives better by leaving, because your presence was the weight that kept them from ever truly moving forward. You were the anchor that held them down, and your departure is the only reason they can now breathe, laugh, and cook without the shadow of your grief hanging over them.",
